From ffc6e14180fd3a567047a86995e0b04e1409957a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: coop-fetch <coop-fetch@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:08:58 -0900
Subject: [PATCH] Co-op bridge: frame hook, AI hold and the co-op module's
 loader

nx2/coop_hooks.py hooks the frame function's two calls in moduleCalc_ and
the AI's calc-bits call (build e0f3ccfa only, words checked); host/coop_bridge.c
loads hookshot_coop.dll beside the game and gives it guest memory, game
function calls, the log and player 1's buttons as the game got them
(host/hos_coop_api.h; host/nn_hid.c keeps that word), and calls it at each
present too (host/nvn_native.c), as the emulator's composite does.
gpu/vk/vk_coop.cpp draws what the module asks for (chat lines, name tags) in
the menu's Dear ImGui frame (hos_coop_draw.h). host/display.c offers key
presses and characters to the module first (its chat box) and host/nn_hid.c
reads no keys while the module has the keyboard. From oot-remake-multiplayer
(GPL-3.0), docs/hookshot.md.
